  "instructions": [
    "Rinse millet under cold water until water runs clear.",
    "Preheat a tandoor clay pot over medium heat and add olive oil.",
    "Sauté onion and garlic until translucent.",
    "Add carrot and tomato, cook for 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in millet, broth, smoked paprika, and sea salt; bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Cover the pot and cook for 20 minutes until millet is tender.",
    "Gently fold in chickpeas and cod cubes, then cover and steam for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley before serving."
